- **Required interface:** `static int check_submodule_url(const char *url)` — file-private. Consumed by retained code immediately below this region (`fsck_gitmodules_fn`), which calls it for each `submodule.<name>.url` value while parsing a `.gitmodules` blob and, on a negative result, reports the `gitmodulesUrl` finding (`"disallowed submodule url: %s"` with the value) against that blob. No code outside `fsck.c` binds to it.
